<title>SWEDEN: SCA/Weyerhaeuser JV in China packaging venture.</title>
<headline>SCA/Weyerhaeuser JV in China packaging venture.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry company SCA and Weyerhaeuser Packaging's joint venture said on Tuesday they were launching a joint venture in China with Wuhan Beverage Two factory.</p>
<p>The joint venture will make transport packaging for Coca Cola among others.  </p>
<p>The new company will be called SCA Weyerhaeuser BinJiang Packaging Co Ltd and the agreement is the equivalent of a $25 million investment.</p>
<p>Under the agreement a new factory will be built at Han Yang. It is expected to be completed in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
